    "interpretation": "The lower edge recedes across the eastern pier and the grey surface meets its top. A vertical-plane interpretation would produce an apparent ~0.35 m strip but misses the visible returning corner. The top edge is the underside of the separate red moulding. The grey exterior intrados is modelled as a horizontal reveal; the measured span in native pixels is not a vertical beam thickness.",
